#: scenario5:scenario5_49EC72D7_464F_45AE_83CA_75CC4C81372F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad61fc219771f405508d5c2eacacfd4809c51974a38b0cd6123ab619b4a08e2e
#. default-sha256: 0145e8326ed9b77878e094d401f204e89742058fb5adaaf8f74053b28416db81
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_49EC72D7_464F_45AE_83CA_75CC4C81372F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Several days had passed since the "
"package arrived; ⟪k:12⟫the end of my third week living in the mansion was drawing near."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Vários dias se passaram desde que o "
"pacote chegou; ⟪k:12⟫o fim da minha terceira semana morando na mansão estava se aproximando."

#: scenario5:scenario5_6150F9D5_5DDC_43DF_A513_607F62A542F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c68adf9f7c1d704f369f23519dcf444003769f6fddef566664c33b396142c00
#. default-sha256: b38a8402c71ad9b5e68d3cbe0464d31bcfa2c22644c5728b50b30b95be3feac5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6150F9D5_5DDC_43DF_A513_607F62A542F3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel wasn’t getting any friendlier, either. ⟪k:1⟫He continued to either snub or bluntly "
"dismiss me whenever we crossed paths."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel não estava ficando mais amigável, também. ⟪k:1⟫Ele continuou me esnobando ou me "
"dispensando sem rodeios sempre que nos cruzávamos."

#: scenario5:scenario5_653649AD_016A_4720_AF8F_1972915C5AE5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aaae75dd872ab867fa32c665637293697fb0134f13eb9e5edc122fcb5465dde8
#. default-sha256: b207cad2c0ec11db24787b800ec2f202180280ecc3d422ca78643c81487a7ebe
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_653649AD_016A_4720_AF8F_1972915C5AE5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I didn’t understand why he acted that way around me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eu não entendia por que ele agia daquela maneira perto de mim."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A8D1483C_9648_4012_B28C_2634220D8C98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7298cd2b01478d84f4a77cfb8d59093155f80ef48d6897d23157fe633c82efd3
#. default-sha256: 81cd9c3b36c7ecdfc66aa3b567c8400ce620f7114c0b5c89b62c80442bcbbb48
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A8D1483C_9648_4012_B28C_2634220D8C98"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But there was little point in asking when he seemed to think there was little point in "
"talking to me at all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas havia pouco sentido em perguntar, quando ele parecia pensar que não havia sentido em "
"falar comigo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F46A383E_C563_49CD_9477_40CF746506DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4a72d0015978e0b5e4f87f3c52312ebcd2467cf78ec1b11dc36744592cdf87b
#. default-sha256: 5606b59eeff6eb4e7dfd5bdc6d40c0725bb154717a7706d5fd6c840541167ae6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F46A383E_C563_49CD_9477_40CF746506DB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Although at first I had been sure there was some way to get him to warm up to me,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Embora no começo eu tivesse certeza de que havia alguma maneira de fazê-lo se aproximar de "
"mim,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_424348E1_F5B1_4CF9_B0EF_CE05648831F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b9b2eccb78ebb153215b87f8d3ead32fbcdb5b9ac043e87baa2232d0551a062
#. default-sha256: 17f84b4419d9ec69ad8e400819a9f3e92406436618c3e56098350ee8710147a3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_424348E1_F5B1_4CF9_B0EF_CE05648831F3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫the more time I spent in the mansion, the more my willpower began to feel like it was at its "
"breaking point."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫quanto mais tempo eu passava na mansão, mais minha força de vontade parecia que estava no "
"ponto de ruptura."

#: scenario5:scenario5_75DBADEE_BB49_47B3_98C8_A69797C4FF12
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0830498d9802501384cecd8ec855c6289ed836f5aefb1adcadc6c3b985273f7a
#. default-sha256: 6df4bae7db5d0505578074797f8f79f701848781c58ccd44dc8d9584b4cac798
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_75DBADEE_BB49_47B3_98C8_A69797C4FF12"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I could tell myself to stay positive until I was blue in the face,⟪k:1⟫but it would only "
"work for so long."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu poderia dizer até ficar sem fôlego para mim mesma me manter positiva,⟪k:1⟫mas só "
"funcionaria por algum tempo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B8A2906C_3079_44F8_ADFE_0610C9535338
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32750717e6e9cfa0afd2433594c77f2b48b522d2f97b98e900616d8524c1dcb6
#. default-sha256: 57e783cdaff4ad969b32767c55c3e02e5ca50d976ad57fe3fc50fa4c35d464fc
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B8A2906C_3079_44F8_ADFE_0610C9535338"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(The one pretty place in the whole house...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(O único lugar bonito em toda a casa...)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9DED7EEC_0722_4C45_9EF7_A984612FE73D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce0ae16436bbc8bdbeadd3f3ed908cb7594b24ef45be04c4e4b8f0b07f771881
#. default-sha256: 6293a5f0e66a77e1fc14f86f7363d02041fa5ee6860a0250ff794242c77d71e2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9DED7EEC_0722_4C45_9EF7_A984612FE73D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I’m glad he hasn’t covered it back up.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Fico feliz por ele não o ter coberto de novo.)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_65804540_F115_420D_AE61_DAB5CE7E94E9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 03a1186fa3d8a64c3e02223b086b498fa9631d41a11190401aef80dcbd706dd6
#. default-sha256: 631fb0bc596487ec1dc88e2f6cdc29e18f1df071fc14fb9a1e07890eef5aa859
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_65804540_F115_420D_AE61_DAB5CE7E94E9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Blue moonlight shone quietly through the stained-glass window,⟪k:1⟫vainly illuminating some "
"of the room."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O luar azul brilhava silenciosamente através do vitral,⟪k:1⟫iluminando vagamente parte da "
"sala."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B0B8F114_8698_4BC0_86F8_3007E9A895A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 52d5aaba1ad231e6bd54a6fc79166abc39ff10b8bfd4b6d84d8c7f44272803ab
#. default-sha256: 972ed747d6d9adc84268bc6b71d874bf8975a4bd82e8e3228bb84cf401d09fc9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B0B8F114_8698_4BC0_86F8_3007E9A895A9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I hadn’t noticed until now, but the room with the stained-glass window appeared to be "
"modeled after a chapel."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu não tinha notado até agora, mas a sala com o vitral parecia ter sido modelada como uma "
"capela."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A0C7AE40_F8C8_4EDA_820A_38D0F5F09337
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4dfb9d419e28f3772a13c65f09be362f983f54753531eb0f9d8545587322eb0
#. default-sha256: 077a854d7c282fb5308c88fc407b9277f44798aa678fb8958db6f6bf9dcec988
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A0C7AE40_F8C8_4EDA_820A_38D0F5F09337"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Rows of pews faced the window, below which sat what used to be a pulpit."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Fileiras de bancos davam para a janela, abaixo da qual ficava o que costumava ser um púlpito."

#: scenario5:scenario5_8C9CA69D_1F12_443C_9D1B_FEB57319275B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 51de0576dd83b5f93ce7a95758205d3e5045462baa4f7e6438780b564334a1b8
#. default-sha256: 823a427a7f2e0c5e0e07cff46fad2f1cd1220b015b67f2bda7ad41cf4f89cf8f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8C9CA69D_1F12_443C_9D1B_FEB57319275B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was very little left of it, though, and an awkward length of silver was mounted to the "
"pulpit’s front face—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Havia muito pouco dele, porém, e um pedaço desajeitado de prata estava preso na face frontal "
"do púlpito—"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7264E601_7DDD_4CA2_9E95_82FC86D64C48
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5537ca589d9136ce9fd2803e7d5015e77d80360f9baf8b0f9822e242f1171b5c
#. default-sha256: b511d21a839055c6d8f43a53460ab5d720d9d8e5bc61b67ac9d1d4448668e9ec
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7264E601_7DDD_4CA2_9E95_82FC86D64C48"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫what was, I assumed, formerly a cross."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫o que era, eu assumi, antigamente uma cruz."

#: scenario5:scenario5_CF7BE4A5_DE3F_454B_884D_538236B1ADDD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11bd77810d243e243eb01a0ce152e8ec3c653a7e1d00a51c9143a3fbd5ee991d
#. default-sha256: fd0080f0a3318d60ef3762c95f55ec664f4eefc614f557c7080505c0d335698b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CF7BE4A5_DE3F_454B_884D_538236B1ADDD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Upon further reflection, rather than facing the window, the pews seemed to be pointed at the "
"pulpit—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫or perhaps the cross hanging on it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Após uma reflexão mais aprofundada, em vez de ficar de frente para a janela, os bancos "
"pareciam estar apontados para o púlpito—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ou talvez a cruz pendurada nele."

#: scenario5:scenario5_8806818E_A5AA_4012_BC56_0518E7F4D082
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df756369b413fa33dc2eb33eeb9198541758ba3536df54d93f73bf91d03b5cfd
#. default-sha256: 72268d74ba8c96b007674d99b0365515806a31d484a29ab8d926f3b01eddfc7e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8806818E_A5AA_4012_BC56_0518E7F4D082"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t sure why there would be a chapel in a mansion, but I had no one to ask about it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu não sabia ao certo por que haveria uma capela em uma mansão, mas não tinha ninguém para "
"perguntar sobre isso."

#: scenario5:scenario5_79CFBF33_6D18_4F97_81E6_C68B8B04EAB1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6114b2d2b2c240a5bc300957bc751572ff811a9ecfd4acfb6308194107f8b76f
#. default-sha256: 2ed070dcb53124acfb233909dfbf27e4c983acfb7576188b48b9deba1a1c7646
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_79CFBF33_6D18_4F97_81E6_C68B8B04EAB1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(For a house of this size, a statue of Christ or the Virgin Mary seems more appropriate.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Para uma casa desse tamanho, uma estátua de Cristo ou da Virgem Maria parece mais "
"apropriado.)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_85244C87_58DA_4179_A1C6_C3252AEFA550
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61f2218bf051ad3c5515474ed9c148fb1129c700edb3b649baa003ba8883e8cb
#. default-sha256: 3db42a1adc45af61aea5d23a11691d7fa358a3c531903fea8b372db418f898db
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_85244C87_58DA_4179_A1C6_C3252AEFA550"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(It’s a very well made chapel, at any rate...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(É uma capela muito bem feita, pelo menos...)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9103FB9B_FF59_407A_B1F5_4CDFE900CFFD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6efc705f3128cd902180e6e085e74e4b8cdc9ca807d80eac65ce49750964cc72
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9103FB9B_FF59_407A_B1F5_4CDFE900CFFD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario5:scenario5_D29F27E2_EC0C_4621_956D_C2A2CD962404
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4b73ee84bfe3fd4b774079ae1e8f88b2b5ff345347ae91ed7a786d9d40e7eb3
#. default-sha256: 7b0938a0cdc0c1b27fbd9b26ef108c1b2fa2623b06bc1aaf6f2c6ee81da3b3e5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D29F27E2_EC0C_4621_956D_C2A2CD962404"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I doubted Michel had had it built for himself. ⟪k:1⟫There would be no reason for him to "
"cover the window if that were the case."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu duvidava que Michel tivesse construído para si mesmo. ⟪k:1⟫Não haveria razão para ele "
"cobrir a janela se fosse esse o caso."

#: scenario5:scenario5_3A7A3407_AF3B_41E4_924C_5F34794B7486
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7f752f45ecb2390b914e0e7846ff108ec28dbec673d7bd9188934f60ce62873d
#. default-sha256: 0a18bc53d061bc65bf3b7c35c5cd67314e97868c18b19b9e8a8a002c674ce7c1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3A7A3407_AF3B_41E4_924C_5F34794B7486"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nor had I ever seen him come to pray."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Nem o tinha visto vir orar algum vez."

#: scenario5:scenario5_BF6E0F10_588D_4AFA_9436_A66EFD5A59CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4833f9330dcd518cc8204770f1a26f775256e025c2c31206b654f6fa22e5834b
#. default-sha256: 9a721bc18abfa9fbb512e239eaf1d00b6054498b1756a1cb5c7eaf437325d866
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BF6E0F10_588D_4AFA_9436_A66EFD5A59CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(He doesn’t seem like one to believe in God.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Ele não parece ser alguém que acredita em Deus.)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0A56A746_2279_407F_84FC_A7A3CE7E50E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb035d2932be571191fa537875f3db9964805ac861335cafa76b6a72e79e4371
#. default-sha256: 34de0fe24221b0d0b22cd9f090d6cdb7813273ca26b7be6133006a25224a7fb9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0A56A746_2279_407F_84FC_A7A3CE7E50E5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(God...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Deus...)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E5007458_122E_4125_9932_037BFC3EE5D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ea73334a52568f05a76770013334a24ca3a556ee46bb345fcab40df8d3d3387
#. default-sha256: d36a93dde0ce0310808ba718d9724cf2f09fa7d9a06e5765fcfcfcd9dde8477a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E5007458_122E_4125_9932_037BFC3EE5D4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I’m not even sure if I...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Eu nem tenho certeza se eu...)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F9324163_17D1_4F00_8DBD_339C28934087
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 81caf5736cde3bf896511dc440df0d233dd438018a4704c4c787a9f87f80327e
#. default-sha256: 22d3ede70bd73318d1224ba8b3da553cad1cda753dbfe79b37ee8ac66853b236
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F9324163_17D1_4F00_8DBD_339C28934087"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If God ⟪k:1⟫really⟪k:2⟫ existed, then surely the world would be a much more pleasant, "
"peaceful place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se Deus ⟪k:1⟫realmente⟪k:2⟫ existisse, então certamente o mundo seria um lugar muito mais "
"agradável e pacífico."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B5F3B961_B5CF_45E1_9686_D8F1AD89AF1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b4a850123dfe5e7cf75d1653271e2ceef13312cefff847d888ec6d2e12f7b81d
#. default-sha256: 5bd908d9eb2cc9378dbfbf1f7826afcabd9517b3cc3b99d8505f7267c0a3f2f2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B5F3B961_B5CF_45E1_9686_D8F1AD89AF1C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No unfair disparities in money or power. ⟪k:1⟫No senseless misfortune.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I certainly "
"wouldn’t have found myself here, either..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sem disparidades injustas de dinheiro ou poder. ⟪k:1⟫Nenhum infortúnio sem sentido.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"Eu certamente não me encontraria aqui, também..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_41BF1485_75AA_4EEA_940F_4F8D64CB0688
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46ea805312ab59e73b71083e5618a4779781e8396f386dbd7eec165782fc2806
#. default-sha256: 75f3077dfca09d9306b20b0e987721ba795b163421b4a222fc3a9e395ff4164c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_41BF1485_75AA_4EEA_940F_4F8D64CB0688"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But God was evidently quite fond of giving mankind “trials,” so He would probably tell me "
"with a straight face that this was one too."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas Deus evidentemente gostava muito de dar “provações” à humanidade, então Ele "
"provavelmente me diria com uma cara séria que isso também era uma."

#: scenario5:scenario5_4D835E2E_5E7F_4F39_9C1A_1B4F94821963
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e4be9d7920764c57ade6b0e2307575321f951567cc960d7abe8e0dd0cff7225
#. default-sha256: 715538e1f5e3c7ce4537740b1f015ef1f9a2066f0615f3e1308297a4569c3366
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4D835E2E_5E7F_4F39_9C1A_1B4F94821963"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Or, perhaps,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ou, talvez,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_97002835_7390_4300_8DD3_6F0E0B5325A9
