msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But their union almost fell apart because she was “not suitable” for him. ⟪k:1⟫Merchants "
"were hardly the lowest class—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas a união deles quase se desfez porque ela “não era adequada” para ele. ⟪k:1⟫Os "
"comerciantes dificilmente eram da classe mais baixa—"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0949ED31_09F9_472D_B559_50857937E097
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
